webkitgtk-bundle/out/
# Created empty by podman on every webkitgtk-bundle build: build.sh bind-mounts the
# real header from ProtonSource over this path, and podman needs the mount target to
# exist. Harmless inside the container, but a 0-byte copy here shadows the real header
# for any host-side compile (quoted includes resolve relative to the including file
# first), so it must never be committed.
webkitgtk-bundle/host/webview2loader_ipc_protocol.h
